gine/godot/pull/109009#issuecomment-3418877866","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109009","id":3418877866,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lx--q","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T22:19:53Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T22:20:35Z","body":"I think it makes more sense as-is, with tapered capsule being a new class. As @lyuma mentioned, this avoids the problem of the height having a different source of truth.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418877866/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3438919383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109009#issuecomment-3438919383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109009","id":3438919383,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7M-b7X","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39